WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:16.927
Everyone was at the movie theater.

2
00:00:16.928 --> 00:00:20.831
"What movie will we see?" asked Dad.

3
00:00:20.832 --> 00:00:24.757
"I like love stories," said Emmy.

4
00:00:24.758 --> 00:00:27.600
"Yuck," said Harry.

5
00:00:27.601 --> 00:00:31.097
"I want to see car chases!"

6
00:00:31.098 --> 00:00:34.826
"No car chases," said Mom.

7
00:00:34.827 --> 00:00:38.362
"The penguin movie looks cute."

8
00:00:38.363 --> 00:00:45.701
"Let's go to the penguin movie," said Dad.

9
00:00:45.702 --> 00:00:52.051
"Yay! Penguins!" cried Oliver.

10
00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:59.626
"Five tickets, please," said Dad.

11
00:00:59.627 --> 00:01:02.720
"Ugh," said Harry.

12
00:01:02.721 --> 00:01:08.620
"It looks like a baby movie."

13
00:01:08.621 --> 00:01:15.560
Dad bought popcorn and soda.

14
00:01:15.561 --> 00:01:19.939
The kids picked out their favorite candy.

15
00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:23.569
Then they all went into the theater.

16
00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:33.153
The theater got dark.

17
00:01:33.154 --> 00:01:36.223
The penguin movie started.

18
00:01:36.224 --> 00:01:39.890
The screen was filled with penguins.

19
00:01:39.891 --> 00:01:43.397
They were in a zoo.

20
00:01:43.398 --> 00:01:47.023
"Look at the penguins!" said Oliver.

21
00:01:47.024 --> 00:01:51.663
"This is going to be boring," thought Harry.

22
00:01:51.664 --> 00:02:00.312
Suddenly the penguins did something funny.

23
00:02:00.313 --> 00:02:05.916
They ran away from the zoo.

24
00:02:05.917 --> 00:02:10.556
The audience laughed.

25
00:02:10.557 --> 00:02:13.570
Harry smiled.

26
00:02:13.571 --> 00:02:16.976
The penguins climbed into a car.

27
00:02:16.977 --> 00:02:20.233
The audience laughed again.

28
00:02:20.234 --> 00:02:24.906
Harry laughed too.

29
00:02:24.907 --> 00:02:30.688
"Stop those penguins!" cried the zookeeper.

30
00:02:30.689 --> 00:02:33.607
Harry laughed hard.

31
00:02:33.608 --> 00:02:38.852
The zookeeper got in a jeep.

32
00:02:38.853 --> 00:02:46.292
The zookeeper drove after the penguins.

33
00:02:46.293 --> 00:02:49.705
"Awesome!" said Harry.

34
00:02:49.706 --> 00:02:56.153
"This movie has a car chase!"
